/// - {@link discussion_board_administrators}: Administrator who imposed the ban
/// - {@link discussion_board_ban_record_of_members}: Member-specific ban
/// details (1:1)
/// - {@link discussion_board_ban_record_of_administrators}:
/// Administrator-specific ban details (1:1)
